{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗發生火警。今日（21日）下午4時40分，警方接獲元州街131號一間餐廳職員報案，指廚房爐頭起火冒煙。消防接報到場，約10分鐘後將火撲熄。火警初步無人受傷，毋須疏散。</p><p>《香港01》接獲讀者提供及網上照片和影片可見，大量濃煙由涉事餐廳湧出，街道煙霧瀰漫，消防員在旁開喉灌救。</p><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，大量濃煙湧出。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200866531362213888219730.jpeg/wPC-jfrNrqlvgP0saz3U3CaxxiTE7xBvFzPmABcz5gA\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，大量濃煙湧出。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，街道煙霧瀰漫。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200867198344630272560437.png/WRguH8o5ISZaGeWWeWGa29FZ4HKSDI8GddrnMlDa5zI\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，街道煙霧瀰漫。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，街道煙霧瀰漫。（Threads@cccarollll_128）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200867205374676992580641.jpeg/0JAuHw0x6S6f5Svxq5dAkPhLhJyd_RT92R3n0Nkd59A\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，街道煙霧瀰漫。（Threads@cccarollll_128）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，街道煙霧瀰漫。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200867201188499456407281.jpeg/FdYGTqOc2i4YVissLtiRKUsUk_SCdp0u1qyrKfOsqyk\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，街道煙霧瀰漫。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，救援人員到場協助。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200867203386445824594673.jpeg/K67IPJbRn1Qzf3rIuQ9QGIdmdubkXFg_cOx6FVXsehU\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，救援人員到場協助。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，大量濃煙湧出。（Threads@tangkinkin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200865785250058240714093.jpeg/nc8Ra7edzQj3SDcUyDoZL5dig987Vi9noR67FqEeuxY\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，大量濃煙湧出。（Threads@tangkinkin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，消防員在旁開喉灌救。（Threads@tangkinkin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200867752332496896908476.png/G7B6VbQWGQhjSOpYy3qyGzvAgCIYMSf89p--lfafvpU\"/><figcaption>深水埗元州街131號一間餐廳廚房起火，消防員在旁開喉灌救。（Threads@tangkinkin）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:50.825039+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":420,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T18:49:14.509541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:57:22.795926+00:00","content_hash":"4119da00488df653581c55286bc8ddeb3d7b24621f82ca5d091085f80adf5f8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}